    "roles": ["band_member", "bandleader", "composer"],
    "summary": "Fela Kuti's drummer and musical director in Africa 70, and with Fela the maker of Afrobeat. Self-taught from jazz records, he played the kit like four drummers: the hi-hat foot chicking every 'and', the hand on the hat around clustered snare strokes, the kick in pairs that rarely marks the 1. He hardly ever filled. Later a bandleader in Paris and the drummer of The Good, the Bad & the Queen."
  },
